ui.roe:notices_n1.title=§lOngoing Translation
ui.roe:notices_n1.body=More languages are being added. §w§r currently supports all languages natively supported by Minecraft. This is not the full, final build for all languages. The translation script may be causing some bilingual errors and mistranslations. Testing is still active and script tweaks are still being made.\n\n:  9th, 2026\n

ui.roe:notices_n2.title=§lKnown Bugs
ui.roe:notices_n2.body=§lMenus§r\nOccasionally, menus may fail to show when opening, preventing any interaction. If you have a controller or keyboard, use those to exit the menu, otherwise you'll likely have to restart Minecraft\n\n§lMusic§r\nParticles may still appear even after switching Player Systems and reloading the world\nRelic particles and audio may persist even after the jukebox explodes when spammed\n\n§lDisc Wiki§r\nRelic icons do not appear correctly when searched\n:  21st, 2026\n

ui.roe:notices_n3.title=§lKey Changes
ui.roe:notices_n3.body=Items are going through Display Name key changes for translations. This process is still ongoing and some items will have translations while others do not. This is expected. Testing is still active.\n:  21st, 2026\n

ui.roe:notices_n4.title=§lPaused Development
ui.roe:notices_n4.body=Development has been temporarily suspended. The next update release is unknown. To compensate for the incomplete recipes, you can now give yourself discs using the Disc Wiki. Collections are temporarily disabled.\n:  6th, 2026\n

